- Index set I and all parameters (r_i, s_i, d_i) are sourced from SmartphoneRetailOutletSalesData.csv (table_id: file_0_view_0), using:
    - Product Name (TABLET models only) → i ∈ I
    - Revenue → r_i
    - Initial Inventory → s_i
    - Demand → d_i

